    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d221-a1">

                <pb facs="0277" n="217" xml:id="pg217"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 6.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Meade to Mr.
                            Smythe</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Consulate</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Santo
                                Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-12-30"><hi rendition="#italic">December 30,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose you here with copies of the
                    depositions of the master, mate, and sailor (with accompanying medical
                    certificate) of the American schooner <hi rendition="#italic">Henry Crosby</hi>,
                    who were connected in the recent shooting affair at Azua, and an account of
                    which has been telegraphed you as received from Consular Agent Hardy at that
                    port.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">l. s.</hi>] <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >John R. Meade</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">United States Consul,
                            Santo Domingo</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
